e section title\">\n                                Occupation des entrepôts\n                            </h2>\n                            <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#69717a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"warehouse count subtitle\">\n                                3 sites\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"grid gap-4 px-5 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"warehouse occupancy entries container\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"Gombe warehouse entry\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"warehouse name and capacity header\">\n                                    <span class=\"font-medium text-[#15191d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"warehouse location name\">\n                                        Kinshasa · Gombe\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#b45309]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"critical capacity percentage\">\n                                        91 %\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#eef0f2]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"capacity progress track bar\">\n                                    <div class=\"h-1.5 w-[91%] rounded-full bg-[#b45309]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"amber progress fill bar (91%)\">\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#69717a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"warehouse package count and age caption\">\n                                    412 colis · ancienneté moy. 3,2 j\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"Baiyun warehouse entry\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"warehouse name and capacity header\">\n                                    <span class=\"font-medium text-[#15191d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"warehouse location name\">\n                                        Guangzhou · Baiyun\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#15191d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"normal capacity percentage\">\n                                        78 %\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#eef0f2]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"capacity progress track bar\">\n                                    <div class=\"h-1.5 w-[78%] rounded-full bg-[#087a46]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"green progress fill bar (78%)\">\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#69717a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"warehouse package count and age caption\">\n                                    638 colis · ancienneté moy. 5,8 j\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"Jebel Ali warehouse entry\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"warehouse name and capacity header\">\n                                    <span class=\"font-medium text-[#15191d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"warehouse location name\">\n                                        Dubaï · Jebel Ali\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#15191d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"low capacity percentage\">\n                                        54 %\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#eef0f2]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"capacity progress track bar\">\n                                    <div class=\"h-1.5 w-[54%] rounded-full bg-[#087a46]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"green progress fill bar (54%)\">\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#69717a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"warehouse package count and age caption\">\n                                    234 colis · ancienneté moy. 2,1 j\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"flex-1 rounded-[12px] border border-[#dfe3e7] bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"recent activity feed section\">\n                        <div class=\"border-b border-[#dfe3e7] px-5 py-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"activity feed header\">\n                            <h2 class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#15191d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"activity feed title\">\n                                Activité récente\n                            </h2>\n                        </div>\n                        <ol class=\"relative px-5 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"activity timeline list\">\n                            <span class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-[23px] top-6 w-px bg-[#dfe3e7]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"timeline vertical connector line\">\n                            </span>\n                            <li class=\"relative flex gap-3 pb-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"payment received timeline event\">\n                                <span class=\"z-10 mt-1.5 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#087a46] ring-4 ring-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"green event dot marker\">\n                                </span>\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"payment event details container\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[13px] text-[#15191d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"payment event description with amount\">\n                                        <span class=\"font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"payment event bold title (Paiement reçu)\">\n                                            Paiement reçu\n                                        </span>\n                                        · 420,00 $\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-[#69717a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"payment event metadata caption\">\n                                        Jean-Paul Kabila · M-Pesa · 09:42\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"relative flex gap-3 pb-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"shipment departure timeline event\">\n                                <span class=\"z-10 mt-1.5 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#1d5fd1] ring-4 ring-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"blue event dot marker\">\n                                </span>\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"shipment event details container\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[13px] text-[#15191d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"shipment event description with ref\">\n                                        <span class=\"font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"shipment event bold reference (EXP-0142)\">\n                                            EXP-0142\n                                        </span>\n                                        a quitté Guangzhou\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-[#69717a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"shipment event metadata caption\">\n                                        86 clients notifiés par WhatsApp · 08:15\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"relative flex gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"packages received timeline event\">\n                                <span class=\"z-10 mt-1.5 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#8a929b] ring-4 ring-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"gray event dot marker\">\n                                </span>\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"receipt event details container\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[13px] text-[#15191d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"receipt event description with count\">\n                                        <span class=\"font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"receipt event bold count (24 colis)\">\n                                            24 colis\n                                        </span>\n                                        réceptionnés à Gombe\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-[#69717a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"receipt event metadata caption\">\n                                        Par Patrick N. · 07:58\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </li>\n                        </ol>\n                    </section>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n</div>\n<script>\n    const air=[22,30,26,34,18,12,28,38,42,33,27,24,40,44,50,41,30,28,46,52,48,42,36,34,55,58,50,45,57,62];\nconst sea=[30,34,32,38,24,18,36,40,44,40,34,32,42,46,52,46,38,36,48,54,50,46,40,40,56,60,54,50,58,64];\nconst el=document.getElementById('bars');\nair.forEach((a,i)=>{const s=sea[i];const col=document.createElement('div');col.className='flex flex-1 flex-col justify-end gap-[2px]';col.style.height='100%';\nconst t=document.createElement('div');t.style.height=(s/150*100)+'%';t.style.background='#9ed8bc';t.style.borderRadius='2px 2px 0 0';\nconst b=document.createElement('div');b.style.height=(a/150*100)+'%';b.style.background=i===29?'#12c76f':'#087a46';\ncol.appendChild(t);col.appendChild(b);el.appendChild(col);});\n</script>\n",
